  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Development Program of the Federal District (PRODEFAZPROFISCO II)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo Hacendario del Distrito Federal (PRODEFAZPROFISCO II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del proyecto es contribuir a la sostenibilidad fiscal del estado a travsde: (i) la modernizacin de la gestin hacendaria; (ii) la mejora de la administracin tributaria; y (iii) la mejora de lagestin del gasto pblico.El presente proyecto es una operacin individual de prstamo bajo la CCLIP-PROFISCO II (BR-X1039)aprobada por el Directorio Ejecutivo mediante Resolucin DE-11317.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to contribute to the state&apos;s fiscal sustainability by: (i) modernizing fiscal management; (ii) improving tax administration; and (iii) improving public expenditure management. This is an individual loan operation under the PROFISCO II CCLIP (BR-X1039) approved by the Board of Executive Directors through Resolution DE-11317.</narrative>
  </description>
